<%- include('../partials/head', { title: 'Your Gladys is not responding', preheader: `No contact with "${instanceName}" for ${offlineFor}.` }) %>
                    <h1 class="gl-h1" style="<%- s.h1 %>">Your Gladys "<%= instanceName %>" is not responding</h1>

                    <p class="gl-p" style="<%- s.p %>">
                      <% if (firstname) { %>Hi <%= firstname %>,<% } else { %>Hi,<% } %>
                    </p>

<%- include('../partials/tile-start', { variant: 'danger' }) %>
                          Your Gladys instance "<strong><%= instanceName %></strong>" has been disconnected from Gladys Plus for <strong><%= offlineFor %></strong>.
                          The last contact with your Gladys was on <%= lastSeenDate %>.
<%- include('../partials/tile-end') %>
                    <p class="gl-p" style="<%- s.p %>">
                      You receive this email because you are an admin of this Gladys Plus account: I warn you when your Gladys is unreachable for more than <%= alertDelay %>.
                      In the meantime, remote access, backups and the Gladys Plus integrations do not work.
                    </p>

                    <p class="gl-p" style="<%- s.pTight %>">
                      A few things to check, from the most common to the rarest:
                    </p>
                    <ul class="gl-p" style="<%- s.p %> padding-left: 22px;">
                      <li style="margin: 0 0 6px;"><strong>Your internet box</strong> crashed or is rebooting: this is the most frequent cause.</li>
                      <li style="margin: 0 0 6px;"><strong>A power outage</strong> at home: the machine running Gladys is off.</li>
                      <li style="margin: 0;"><strong>The SD card or the disk</strong> of the machine died, or Gladys does not start anymore after an update.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <p class="gl-p" style="<%- s.p %>">
                      If you can, ask someone at home to check that the internet box and the machine are powered on.
                      As soon as your Gladys is connected again, you will receive an email to confirm it.
                    </p>

                    <p class="gl-p" style="<%- s.p %>">
                      You can change this delay or disable these alerts in Gladys, under <strong>Settings → Gladys Plus</strong>.
                      A question? Simply reply to this email or write to me at
                      <a href="mailto:hello@gladysassistant.com" class="gl-link" style="<%- s.link %>">hello@gladysassistant.com</a>.
                    </p>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
